{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09655","headline":"东归发犍爲至泥谿舟中作 · 岑参","name":"东归发犍爲至泥谿舟中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前日解侯印，泛舟归山东。\n平旦发犍爲，逍遥信回风。\n七月江水大，沧波涨秋空。\n复有峨眉僧，诵经在舟中。\n夜泊防虎豹，朝行逼鱼龙。\n一道鸣迅湍，两边走连峰。\n猿拂岸花落，鸟啼檐树重。\n烟霭吴楚连，泝沿湖海通。\n忆昨在西掖，复曾入南宫。\n日出朝圣人，端笏陪羣公。\n不意今弃置，何由豁心胸。\n吾当海上去，且学乘桴翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}